      "text": "One adorable GOLDEN SYRIAN HAMSTER cartoon animal friend, standing upright on two very tiny round feet, full body. Huge wide rounded head with plump pouch cheeks, two TINY circular ears, a very short round muzzle. Soft honey gold fur on the entire forehead and crown, a broad smooth CREAM lower face covering both large cheeks and the muzzle. The forehead is one plain unmarked golden color. Tiny glossy black round dot eyes with one tiny white catchlight each, very small straight eyebrows, a tiny pink nose, a tiny w shaped happy mouth. Round cream belly on a small chubby torso. Two short soft rounded mitten arms at its sides. The silhouette is simple, rounded and compact. Head about two thirds of total height. Clean BOLD BLACK ink outline with one consistent thickness around the head, body and feet. Soft flat pastel colors with one very subtle underside shadow. A simple cozy illustrated cafe animal character. Nearly frontal pose slightly facing right. All four short limbs visible, clear separate head and body. Plain warm ivory background, no objects, no clothes, no text. Smooth unmarked fur, no stripes or head markings. Tail hidden."
